        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ikīndīkīlo lya tala",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūngalūngaga nū Alooni ūng'wīle gīkī, “Ūlū ūlījigolanya ī tala ījo mpungatī, jihelage mu mbika ya gīkī ūlū jūbaka, ū būūpe wajo būyūtwima ū kū būtongi w'ikīndīkīlo lya tala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Alooni wīta chene, ūjitūūla ī tala jenījo gīkī jiyūtwima ū kū būtongi walyo ī likīndīkīlo lya tala, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīla ū Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likīndīkīlo lya tala lyalī lībeejiwe lya zahabu īsulile, yūbiza shikolo shimò, kwandīja kwitina lyaho kūshisha kū būlabo walyo. Ī likīndīkīlo lya tala lyenīlo līkabeejiwa kūlenganīla nū mumo Musa walī oolekejiwa na SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kweejiwa kwa Balawī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla hangī ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Basolanhyage a Balawī kūfuma ū mu Baisilaeli, ūbeeje beela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo īyo yigelile kūbīītīla kūlwa nguno ya kwejiwa kwabo yīyī: Ūkūbaseeseebela minzī meela, hūna ūbawīle kūmooga, pye ū booya wa mīlī ū gose; nī shizwalo shabo bafule, babize beela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho bakūsola nzagamba mūūga, na shakwinha shayo sha būsu būnogu būsangije maguta. Hūna nū bebe ūkūsola nzagamba yīngī mūūga, ya kūfunyiwa kūbiza shitambò sha būkenaagūji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūkūbeenha a Balawī kū būtongi w'iheema lya kwibilingīla, hūna ūbakuminge pye a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Balawī ūbeegeleja kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, a Baisilaeli babatūūlīle makono gabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nang'hwe ū Alooni ūbeenha a Balawī benabo kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, ūbatūūla kūlī SEEBA, būbiza shitambò sha kūyengeejiwa sha kūfuma kū Baisilaeli; ū mu gīko bakūbiza bigeleelwa kūgwīta ū nīmo go ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho a Balawī bakūtūūla a makono gabo a ha mitwe ya nzagamba ja kūfunyiwa kūlwa shitambò. Ī ya shitambò kūlwa būkenaagūji ūkwīfunya kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, ī ya shitambò sha kūpemva ūkwīfunya kūlwa nguno ya kūbeeja isangī kūlwa ya Balawī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūkūbawīla a Balawī kwīmīīla kū būtongi bo ng'wa Alooni na bitūnja bakwe, babatūūle kūlī SEEBA babize shitambò sha kūyengeejiwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkomanyiwa kwa Balawī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu nzīla yenīyo ūkūbiza wabakomanya a Balawī kūfuma ū mu Baisilaeli a bangī; na lūūlū a Balawī bakūbiza bane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūmala ū kūbafunya a Balawī gītī shitambò sha kūyengeejiwa, bakūbiza beela; kwandīja ikanza lyenīlo bakūyingīla ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla kūbeeja milīmo yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu Baisilaeli pye a bose, a benabo hū bene abo bakūbiza baafunyiagwa mu būshikanu bose babize bane. Nguno naabasolile kūbiza bane a ha ng'wanya gwa babyalwa ba kwandya a bagosha, pye a babyalwa ba kwandya mu nda ja baninaabo ū mu bakīma bose a ba Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu Baisilaeli, ngosha ose ose ū wa kwandya kūbyalwa alī wane; pye nū ntugo ū gwa kwandya kūbyalwa gūlī gwane. Nakabasola nūbīīta kūbiza bane lūshikū lwene naababūlagaga pye a babyalwa ba kwandya ba bana Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū naabasolile a Balawī gīkī babize bane a ha ng'wanya gwa babyalwa ba kwandya ba Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu Baisilaeli a bose, a Balawī nang'winhaga Alooni na bitūnja bakwe kūlwa būtūmami bo ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla, a benabo hū bakūbiza batūmami a ha ng'wanya gwa Baisilaeli a bose; hū bakūbiza babeeja ba isangī kūlwa nguno ya Baisilaeli a bose, batizūgwīlwa ikūla kūlwa kwegeela a hipandī lyeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa nū Alooni hamò nī libità lya Baisilaeli ī lyose būbīītīla a Balawī gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīla ū Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Balawī biyeeja, būfula nī shizwalo shabo. Hūna ū Alooni ūbatūūla ū kūlī SEEBA gītī shitambò sha kūyengeejiwa; ūbeeja na isangī kūlwa nguno yabo, kūbīngīja būsoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho, a Balawī biza kūbeeja ī milīmo yabo ū ng'wheema lya kwibilingīla; būbiza batūmami ha sīlīlī ya ng'wa Alooni na bitūnja bakwe. A Balawī bakīītīlwa pyī ī yose kūlenganīla nū mumo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīla Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yīyī mihayo yīngī kūlwa nguno ya Balawī: Abo bakūyiza ū ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla kūbeeja milīmo, bakūbiza ba myaka ya kwandīja ha makūmi abīlī n'ītanò kūja kū būtongi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ūlū būshisha myaka makūmi atanò, shiigelile bifuule, booyī ī milīmo yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badūgije ū kūbagunanha a badūgū babo ū ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla ūlū balībeeja ī milīmo, alīyo a boi benekīlī yaya ū kwīta ī milīmo. H'ūmo ūkūbahelela a Balawī ī milīmo yabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.8.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
